# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dory.md — top-level environment template
#
# This repo has THREE env surfaces. The full, authoritative inventory lives in
# docs/ENVIRONMENT.md. Quick map:
#   - backend/.env        → backend API + intelligence engine  (see backend/.env.example)
#   - frontend/.env.local → the Vite SPA                        (see frontend/.env.example)
#   - this file           → convenience for running the intelligence engine alone
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Critical for any deployment (see backend/.env.example) ──────────────
# DORY_ENV must be a non-dev value in production; JWT_SECRET is then REQUIRED
# (the backend fails fast at boot without it).
DORY_ENV=dev
JWT_SECRET=

# Production CORS allow-list (exact origins, comma separated). No default
# outside dev — unset means cross-origin browser requests are blocked.
# CORS_ALLOW_ORIGINS=https://app.dory.md

# ── Groq API Key (for classifier + quiz generator) ─────────────────────
# Get yours at: https://console.groq.com
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
